      "claim": "A morpholine-containing heteroaromatic compound showed excellent CNS penetration in mice (Kp 11.4) with negligible P-gp efflux, supporting meaningful brain access for the morpholine-substituted heteroaromatic query.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
